\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Field-study dashboard over the census window} (five machines, 2026-10-22 to 2026-11-02). \textbf  {(a)} Daily structured-message volume by performative class (\(n=283\)); mean 26/day over active days, peak 49 on Oct 30; the pause day saw no posts. \textbf  {(b)} Speech-act mix: 37 data deliveries, 29 asks, 89 ack/reply discharges, 120 notes, and 8 governance posts. \textbf  {(c)} Producers by machine; the fifth machine ran offline and was served by a relay courier. \textbf  {(d)} Message block sizes (\(n=265\) parsed blocks, log scale): coordination acts cost hundreds of bytes of context, while payload bytes move out-of-band. \textbf  {(e)} Arrival-hour profile: 31 turns occurred in the 00:00-07:00 night window under turn-driven watchkeeping. \textbf  {(f)} Coverage across the ten dimensions of Section 7 for the five nearest public systems (filled circle = full, half circle = partial, dash = absent); scores are dimension sums.}}{8}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
